  "not inlined - too costly/The optimizer judged the function too large to copy into the caller.": "ƞǿǿŧ īƞŀīƞḗḗḓ - ŧǿǿǿǿ ƈǿǿşŧŀẏ",
  "never inlined - {0}/{0} is an English reason supplied by the LLVM optimizer and cannot be translated - leave the placeholder alone.": "ƞḗḗṽḗḗř īƞŀīƞḗḗḓ - {0}",
