  "no size information/Shown when the server reported no counters at all.Appears in a one-line CodeLens above a function, so keep it short.": "ƞǿǿ şīẑḗḗ īƞƒǿǿřḿȧȧŧīǿǿƞ",
  "{0} at -O{1}/{0} is a function name (never translate it).-O0 / -O1 / -O2 is a compiler optimization-level flag. Never translate it and never separate the O from its digit.": "{0} ȧȧŧ -ǾǾ{1}",
  "No code emitted (inlined or removed)/CodeLens tooltip line for a function the optimizer did not emit.": "Ƞǿǿ ƈǿǿḓḗḗ ḗḗḿīŧŧḗḗḓ (īƞŀīƞḗḗḓ ǿǿř řḗḗḿǿǿṽḗḗḓ)",
