  "Machine instructions: {0}/Count of CPU instructions emitted for this function.": "Ḿȧȧƈħīƞḗḗ īƞşŧřŭŭƈŧīǿǿƞş: {0}",
  "Stack frame: {0} bytes/Stack space this function reserves for its locals and spills.": "Şŧȧȧƈķ ƒřȧȧḿḗḗ: {0} ƀẏŧḗḗş",
